<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's IGCP accepts no 3-yr bond bids.</title>
<headline>Portugal's IGCP accepts no 3-yr bond bids.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Institute for Public Credit Management (IGCP) said it accepted no bids at the Institute's offer of 20 billion escudos of three-year bonds on Friday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
